(7317114, 1141517, 176157, '<td valign="top">Is there a cat in this photo? This is a very weird, but intriguing photo - almost disturbing, and I can''t connect the photo to the song (which is a great song btw).</td>', 'Is there a cat in this photo? This is a very weird, but intriguing photo - almost disturbing, and I can''t connect the photo to the song (which is a great song btw).', '2015-02-15 01:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317120, 1141382, 176157, '<td valign="top">She''s beautiful!  And the song is too.  Wow.  Those eyes... This photo induces emotion - with and without the song.  The whole word is going on around her, and she''s in a different place.  Good job. (I think).</td>', 'She''s beautiful!  And the song is too.  Wow.  Those eyes... This photo induces emotion - with and without the song.  The whole word is going on around her, and she''s in a different place.  Good job. (I think).', '2015-02-15 01:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317211, 1141475, 173844, '<td valign="top">Formidably illustrates the title.  But, in a pleasing and charming way.  The pieces of the composition come together like a jigsaw puzzle.  There''s a sense of mystery in the walls and vanishing dogleg street.  The green of vegetation is a relief.  And there are chances of escape --  the bright white door, the street drains, the streets which must continue somewhere and the bird in the distance.  One of two personal favorites.</td>', 'Formidably illustrates the title.  But, in a pleasing and charming way.  The pieces of the composition come together like a jigsaw puzzle.  There''s a sense of mystery in the walls and vanishing dogleg street.  The green of vegetation is a relief.  And there are chances of escape --  the bright white door, the street drains, the streets which must continue somewhere and the bird in the distance.  One of two personal favorites.', '2015-02-15 12:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317221, 1141516, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, wonderfully calm.  The hypnotic blues, subtly rhythmic, the gold necklace of human habitation stretching along the shoreline and the snow-capped mountains combine simply and effectively.  The moon and its reflection, as well as the nicely placed foreground rocks, are fine touches.  Beautiful.  One of two personal favorites.</td>', 'Yes, wonderfully calm.  The hypnotic blues, subtly rhythmic, the gold necklace of human habitation stretching along the shoreline and the snow-capped mountains combine simply and effectively.  The moon and its reflection, as well as the nicely placed foreground rocks, are fine touches.  Beautiful.  One of two personal favorites.', '2015-02-15 12:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317265, 1141517, 61396, '<td valign="top">great colors (and I can see a cat). thanks!</td>', 'great colors (and I can see a cat). thanks!', '2015-02-15 15:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317266, 1141370, 61396, '<td valign="top">zz over the top?! but I like it.</td>', 'zz over the top?! but I like it.', '2015-02-15 15:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317268, 1141296, 61396, '<td valign="top">great example of framed composition.</td>', 'great example of framed composition.', '2015-02-15 15:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317269, 1141474, 109363, '<td valign="top">Spandau Ballet?  excellent!</td>', 'Spandau Ballet?  excellent!', '2015-02-15 15:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317294, 1141296, 173844, '<td valign="top">An artist can find and devise beauty out of the commonplace that most people walk by, letting the wondrous moments stream into banality.  Such is this photographer.  And I''m hard put to explain why I feel so moved by this image.  Perhaps it has to do with the discontinuities.  Perhaps with the essentially triangular composition, adroitly secured by the smudges of snow at bottom center.  Perhaps by admiration of his vision.<br/>A third co-favorite.</td>', 'An artist can find and devise beauty out of the commonplace that most people walk by, letting the wondrous moments stream into banality.  Such is this photographer.  And I''m hard put to explain why I feel so moved by this image.  Perhaps it has to do with the discontinuities.  Perhaps with the essentially triangular composition, adroitly secured by the smudges of snow at bottom center.  Perhaps by admiration of his vision.A third co-favorite.', '2015-02-15 18:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317320, 1141522, 100831, '<td valign="top">appropriately titled.. I like the image.</td>', 'appropriately titled.. I like the image.', '2015-02-15 18:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317321, 1141296, 100831, '<td valign="top">Great song and the image fits ... I was walking up the street and dreaming too.</td>', 'Great song and the image fits ... I was walking up the street and dreaming too.', '2015-02-15 18:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317325, 1141453, 100831, '<td valign="top">I feel the heat. I hope someday I hear/see this LIVE!</td>', 'I feel the heat. I hope someday I hear/see this LIVE!', '2015-02-15 18:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317330, 1141478, 100831, '<td valign="top">I can''t say why, exactly, the image appeals but it fits the music.</td>', 'I can''t say why, exactly, the image appeals but it fits the music.', '2015-02-15 18:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317332, 1141380, 100831, '<td valign="top">She''s pretty... love the colors and light.</td>', 'She''s pretty... love the colors and light.', '2015-02-15 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317341, 1141515, 136989, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and contrast with the foreground.  This image offered me the mental serenity required after a weekend of homework. I''d love to walk along the shore ...  My favorite in this challenge.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1082013" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/136989/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1082013.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Beautiful colors and contrast with the foreground.  This image offered me the mental serenity required after a weekend of homework. I''d love to walk along the shore ...  My favorite in this challenge.', '2015-02-15 18:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317351, 1141453, 150277, '<td valign="top">I love this image. Beautiful colors, fancy dress, and a bit of abstractness. My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'I love this image. Beautiful colors, fancy dress, and a bit of abstractness. My favorite of the challenge.', '2015-02-15 19:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317352, 1141522, 150277, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, great capture for the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful, great capture for the challenge.', '2015-02-15 19:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317353, 1141388, 150277, '<td valign="top">Great creativity and perfect execution to me.</td>', 'Great creativity and perfect execution to me.', '2015-02-15 19:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317354, 1141517, 150277, '<td valign="top">What a fun image. I like the bit of a pattern along with a bit of abstracness.  I also like the colors.</td>', 'What a fun image. I like the bit of a pattern along with a bit of abstracness.  I also like the colors.', '2015-02-15 19:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317355, 1141509, 150277, '<td valign="top">Great capture for the challenge.</td>', 'Great capture for the challenge.', '2015-02-15 19:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317362, 1141296, 50864, '<td valign="top">Sharon should be happy.</td>', 'Sharon should be happy.', '2015-02-15 19:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317364, 1141453, 50864, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and perfect for Spanish music.</td>', 'Beautiful image and perfect for Spanish music.', '2015-02-15 19:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317389, 1141388, 173844, '<td valign="top">So interesting and provokes a complicated pleasure.  I really like how the camera focus is lovingly on the foreground swing, the emotional focus is on the out of focus assertively posed woman and the background is a further out of focus kind of institutional setting.  Holds the attention and draws the viewer in.</td>', 'So interesting and provokes a complicated pleasure.  I really like how the camera focus is lovingly on the foreground swing, the emotional focus is on the out of focus assertively posed woman and the background is a further out of focus kind of institutional setting.  Holds the attention and draws the viewer in.', '2015-02-15 21:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317390, 1141519, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful combination of blue-grays and orange set free over a vast landscape.  Attention grabbing terrain is completely unnecessary in this watercolor exploration of hue and interpenetration.</td>', 'Beautiful combination of blue-grays and orange set free over a vast landscape.  Attention grabbing terrain is completely unnecessary in this watercolor exploration of hue and interpenetration.', '2015-02-15 21:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317393, 1141528, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perfect title. These adorable children seem to bubble with life right out of the frame.  The way they''re lying on their bellies and the way the photographer meets them at their level helps make the picture.  Though it''s in black and white it seems to be in color --  such is the life force.</td>', 'Perfect title. These adorable children seem to bubble with life right out of the frame.  The way they''re lying on their bellies and the way the photographer meets them at their level helps make the picture.  Though it''s in black and white it seems to be in color --  such is the life force.', '2015-02-15 21:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317394, 1141492, 173844, '<td valign="top">Just mesmerizing.  The transitions depicted in the puddle as it overspreads the manhole cover are delicate and eloquent.  A wonderful eye at work.  And so suitable to the song title.</td>', 'Just mesmerizing.  The transitions depicted in the puddle as it overspreads the manhole cover are delicate and eloquent.  A wonderful eye at work.  And so suitable to the song title.', '2015-02-15 21:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317395, 1141473, 173844, '<td valign="top">Eerily eye-catching and very nicely lit.  Like it a lot.</td>', 'Eerily eye-catching and very nicely lit.  Like it a lot.', '2015-02-15 21:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317396, 1141380, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait that surely captures the tone of the title.  Modestly situated so that she''s harmoniously balanced with the trees to her left.  Her scarf is a wonderful chime of color.</td>', 'Lovely portrait that surely captures the tone of the title.  Modestly situated so that she''s harmoniously balanced with the trees to her left.  Her scarf is a wonderful chime of color.', '2015-02-15 22:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317397, 1141509, 173844, '<td valign="top">The rolling mountains peek out almost coyly from the curtain of foreground foliage, enjoyable to look at in itself, but the image is all about the quality of light before a storm.  That comes across in a beautiful and satisfying way.</td>', 'The rolling mountains peek out almost coyly from the curtain of foreground foliage, enjoyable to look at in itself, but the image is all about the quality of light before a storm.  That comes across in a beautiful and satisfying way.', '2015-02-15 22:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317398, 1141534, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely caught moment that makes me smile.  The earth tones tie it all up in a warm package.</td>', 'Nicely caught moment that makes me smile.  The earth tones tie it all up in a warm package.', '2015-02-15 22:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317399, 1141512, 173844, '<td valign="top">Luscious seascape that draws one into the moment.  I like it a lot.  It appears to me that the clouds are doing the dancing and the foreground figure is doing the scratching.</td>', 'Luscious seascape that draws one into the moment.  I like it a lot.  It appears to me that the clouds are doing the dancing and the foreground figure is doing the scratching.', '2015-02-15 22:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317401, 1141369, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simple reversal that brings the icicles to life.  I like the pink tones that glimmer from within.  Handsomely done.</td>', 'Simple reversal that brings the icicles to life.  I like the pink tones that glimmer from within.  Handsomely done.', '2015-02-15 22:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317406, 1141437, 173844, '<td valign="top">I love the overall luminosity of this image that actually lends a feeling of warmth to this frigid scene.  The composition is nicely balanced.  My only quibble is, needs some trudging...</td>', 'I love the overall luminosity of this image that actually lends a feeling of warmth to this frigid scene.  The composition is nicely balanced.  My only quibble is, needs some trudging...', '2015-02-15 22:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317420, 1141492, 100831, '<td valign="top">An enjoyable reflection:)</td>', 'An enjoyable reflection:)', '2015-02-15 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317421, 1141476, 100831, '<td valign="top">Great candid moment - well captured!</td>', 'Great candid moment - well captured!', '2015-02-15 23:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317422, 1141456, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective - big guns!</td>', 'Love the perspective - big guns!', '2015-02-15 23:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317423, 1141522, 173844, '<td valign="top">A handsome egret, nicely posed.  It''s the sparkling water and, particularly, the sun''s reflection that lend beauty and magic to this winning image.  It''s molten amber and dropping down like a tornado into the serenity of the moment.  A fine marriage of cool and brilliant.</td>', 'A handsome egret, nicely posed.  It''s the sparkling water and, particularly, the sun''s reflection that lend beauty and magic to this winning image.  It''s molten amber and dropping down like a tornado into the serenity of the moment.  A fine marriage of cool and brilliant.', '2015-02-15 23:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317425, 1141476, 173844, '<td valign="top">The wonderful fun, love and joy of this picture shouldn''t cause us to miss the well-composed disposition of the people and the harmonious variety of fabric.  Just terrific.</td>', 'The wonderful fun, love and joy of this picture shouldn''t cause us to miss the well-composed disposition of the people and the harmonious variety of fabric.  Just terrific.', '2015-02-15 23:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317426, 1141492, 19825, '<td valign="top">Well spotted. Nicely done.</td>', 'Well spotted. Nicely done.', '2015-02-15 23:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317427, 1141379, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simply rotating this image taken under a pier transforms it into something passing strange and marvelous.  Et voila, surrealism. Beautifully done.</td>', 'Simply rotating this image taken under a pier transforms it into something passing strange and marvelous.  Et voila, surrealism. Beautifully done.', '2015-02-15 23:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317428, 1141517, 19825, '<td valign="top">Captivating abstract.</td>', 'Captivating abstract.', '2015-02-15 23:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317429, 1141370, 100831, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!</td>', 'Wonderful!', '2015-02-15 23:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317430, 1141251, 19825, '<td valign="top">Joyfully jarring. Bump.</td>', 'Joyfully jarring. Bump.', '2015-02-15 23:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317431, 1141528, 19825, '<td valign="top">A perfect portrait.</td>', 'A perfect portrait.', '2015-02-15 23:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317432, 1141388, 19825, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2015-02-15 23:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317433, 1141251, 173844, '<td valign="top">The dog in this kind of high key image playfully and assertively fills the frame to great effect.  Though very real and coming right at ya, the motion blur gives it the contradictory sense of a fuzzy stuffed animal.  Great portrait.</td>', 'The dog in this kind of high key image playfully and assertively fills the frame to great effect.  Though very real and coming right at ya, the motion blur gives it the contradictory sense of a fuzzy stuffed animal.  Great portrait.', '2015-02-15 23:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317434, 1141475, 100831, '<td valign="top">The band may not have hit it big but they had an awesome cover idea - well done!</td>', 'The band may not have hit it big but they had an awesome cover idea - well done!', '2015-02-15 23:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317436, 1141517, 100831, '<td valign="top">Cat Stevens was one of my favorites way back when! I love how you did this. Great job!</td>', 'Cat Stevens was one of my favorites way back when! I love how you did this. Great job!', '2015-02-15 23:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317437, 1141453, 173844, '<td valign="top">The ambiguity of the woman and the surrounding scene, attractive in itself, is greatly buoyed by the sumptuous purples, blue-green and orange.  It''s a beautiful, complicated confection.</td>', 'The ambiguity of the woman and the surrounding scene, attractive in itself, is greatly buoyed by the sumptuous purples, blue-green and orange.  It''s a beautiful, complicated confection.', '2015-02-15 23:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317438, 1141317, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective... great exposure to catch the vibration!</td>', 'Nice perspective... great exposure to catch the vibration!', '2015-02-15 23:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317439, 1141468, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine portrait, terrific use of the bright red.</td>', 'Fine portrait, terrific use of the bright red.', '2015-02-15 23:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317440, 1141517, 173844, '<td valign="top">I cannot penetrate this image more than to say it''s a surrealistic abstract, yet quite fascinating.</td>', 'I cannot penetrate this image more than to say it''s a surrealistic abstract, yet quite fascinating.', '2015-02-15 23:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317441, 1141524, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stark realism, yet there is something about his smile that hints at additional depth.</td>', 'Stark realism, yet there is something about his smile that hints at additional depth.', '2015-02-15 23:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317442, 1141529, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice image cleverly suited to the title.</td>', 'Nice image cleverly suited to the title.', '2015-02-15 23:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317443, 1141515, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunrise/set that reminds me of the calm found in Japanese wood-prints.  Subjective note -- shame about that contrail.</td>', 'Lovely sunrise/set that reminds me of the calm found in Japanese wood-prints.  Subjective note -- shame about that contrail.', '2015-02-15 23:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317445, 1141486, 173844, '<td valign="top">Bold and emotional explosion of color, shapes and motion.</td>', 'Bold and emotional explosion of color, shapes and motion.', '2015-02-15 23:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317447, 1141468, 114285, '<td valign="top">Kind of meets the challenge, a lot more than others for sure, just wondering what emotion you''re portraying since that''s what the challenge theme is!</td>', 'Kind of meets the challenge, a lot more than others for sure, just wondering what emotion you''re portraying since that''s what the challenge theme is!', '2015-02-15 23:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317448, 1141456, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine perspective and composition, gritty subject, handsomely handled.</td>', 'Fine perspective and composition, gritty subject, handsomely handled.', '2015-02-15 23:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317450, 1141474, 173844, '<td valign="top">Pleasing flow, composition and desaturated palette.</td>', 'Pleasing flow, composition and desaturated palette.', '2015-02-15 23:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317452, 1141463, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely study.</td>', 'Lovely study.', '2015-02-15 23:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317453, 1141533, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing yields beautiful result ---  looks like an ice carving.</td>', 'Interesting processing yields beautiful result ---  looks like an ice carving.', '2015-02-15 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317455, 1141386, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.</td>', 'Beautiful scene.', '2015-02-15 23:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317456, 1141507, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine casual, intimate image with terrific colors.</td>', 'Fine casual, intimate image with terrific colors.', '2015-02-15 23:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317459, 1141403, 173844, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very fine photograph, but I eased back in my rating because of my personal distaste for using violence as a prop.</td>', 'I think this is a very fine photograph, but I eased back in my rating because of my personal distaste for using violence as a prop.', '2015-02-15 23:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317461, 1141408, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.</td>', 'Very sweet.', '2015-02-15 23:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317462, 1141491, 173844, '<td valign="top">This sure carries the moment.</td>', 'This sure carries the moment.', '2015-02-15 23:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7317466, 1141382, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  The main figure seems so lost in thought and the background figures and bright green set her off well.</td>', 'Very nice image.  The main figure seems so lost in thought and the background figures and bright green set her off well.', '2015-02-15 23:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
